Dependencies bundled into camera-vision.jar at build time:

- tensorflow-lite.jar      : org.tensorflow:tensorflow-lite:2.16.1 classes.jar (from the AAR)
- tensorflow-lite-api.jar  : org.tensorflow:tensorflow-lite-api:2.16.1 classes.jar (from the AAR)
- zxing-core.jar           : com.google.zxing:core:3.5.3 (Maven Central)
- jni/<abi>/libtensorflowlite_jni.so : JNI libs from the tensorflow-lite 2.16.1 AAR

The host app also ships TFLite, but R8 renames its Java API, so the mod carries
its own complete copy (classes dexed in, .so extracted at runtime) and loads it
through a child-first classloader. Nothing here is resolved from the host.

Fetch with:
  curl -sL https://repo1.maven.org/maven2/com/google/zxing/core/3.5.3/core-3.5.3.jar -o zxing-core.jar
  curl -sL https://repo1.maven.org/maven2/org/tensorflow/tensorflow-lite/2.16.1/tensorflow-lite-2.16.1.aar -o /tmp/tflite.aar
    then unzip classes.jar -> tensorflow-lite.jar and jni/{arm64-v8a,armeabi-v7a}/libtensorflowlite_jni.so -> jni/
  curl -sL https://repo1.maven.org/maven2/org/tensorflow/tensorflow-lite-api/2.16.1/tensorflow-lite-api-2.16.1.aar -o /tmp/tflite-api.aar
    then unzip classes.jar -> tensorflow-lite-api.jar
